{"unit":125,"section":5,"cefr":"B1","objective":"discuss Israeli and Jewish history","skill":"History","heading":"History vocabulary","phrases":[{"he":"מדינת ישראל הכריזה על עצמאות.","en":"The State of Israel declared independence.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"מדינת","h":["state of"]},{"w":"ישראל","h":["Israel"]},{"w":"הכריזה","h":["declared"]},{"w":"על","h":["on","about"]},{"w":"עצמאות","h":["independence"]}]},{"he":"השואה היא אסון נורא.","en":"The Holocaust is a terrible disaster.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"השואה","h":["the Holocaust"]},{"w":"היא","h":["is","she"]},{"w":"אסון","h":["disaster"]},{"w":"נורא","h":["terrible"]}]},{"he":"כולם רוצים שלום.","en":"Everyone wants peace.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"כולם","h":["everyone"]},{"w":"רוצים","h":["want"]},{"w":"שלום","h":["peace"]}]},{"he":"הציונות היא תנועה לאומית.","en":"Zionism is a national movement.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"הציונות","h":["Zionism"]},{"w":"היא","h":["is"]},{"w":"תנועה","h":["movement"]},{"w":"לאומית","h":["national"]}]},{"he":"המלחמה הסתיימה סוף סוף.","en":"The war finally ended.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"המלחמה","h":["the war"]},{"w":"הסתיימה","h":["ended","was over"]},{"w":"סוף","h":["end"]},{"w":"סוף","h":["finally"]}]}],"sentences":[{"he":"אנחנו רוצים שלום.","en":"We want peace.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"המלחמה נגמרה.","en":"The war ended.","alt":["The war is over."],"t":"t"},{"he":"זו מדינה קטנה.","en":"This is a small country.","alt":["This is a small state."],"t":"l"},{"he":"השואה הייתה נוראה.","en":"The Holocaust was terrible.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הכיבוש לא טוב.","en":"The occupation is not good.","alt":["The conquest is not good."],"t":"t"},{"he":"הוא לומד היסטוריה.","en":"He studies history.","alt":["He is studying history."],"t":"t"},{"he":"מתי הייתה ההכרזה?","en":"When was the declaration?","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"היא חוקרת את השואה.","en":"She researches the Holocaust.","alt":["She is researching the Holocaust."],"t":"l"},{"he":"אף אחד לא רוצה מלחמה.","en":"No one wants